"The quest the Emperor gave Rin Zaoh is to unite the entire world, by conquest if need be."
"The Nameless Hell Hound serves as a secret shadow agent of the Empire, codenamed Yamiko."
"Only her pack, the Vulpyr and a few officers know of Yamiko; she is kept as a hidden asset."
"The Empire keeps agents inside the Scorched Steeps Tribe."
"Through a proxy, the Empire is bargaining to buy one of the twin Hell Hounds from the Steeps."
"The Empire knows other Earth transmigrators and keeps their names classified."
"The binder's questions test for numbered source worlds; Earth is world fourteen."
"The Vulpyr is held in the palace as a guest and secretly probes the hidden royal wing."
"Palace attendant Aiko spread the tale that Rin Zaoh was raised by monsters in the Depths."
"The captured Iron March spy Sakura is being trained as an agent of the Empire."
